                    9,
                    'Select Media, LLC operates www.fansly.com (\u201cFansly\u201d) and qualifies as a \u201cService Provider\u201d within the meaning of 17 U.S.C. \xa7 512(k)(1) of the Digital Millennium Copyright Act (\u201cDMCA\u201d). Accordingly, it is entitled to certain protections from claims of copyright infringement under the DMCA, commonly referred to as the \u201csafe harbor\u201d provisions. We respect the intellectual property of others, and we ask our users to do the same. Thus, we observe and comply with the DMCA, and have adopted the following Notice and Takedown Policy relating to claims of copyright infringement by our users. '
