            ' We provide a robust system for you to report content or user activities that are illegal or otherwise in violation of our Terms of Service or credit card association policies (collectively, the \u201cRules\u201d). We intend to operate this system as efficiently and quickly as possible in a fair and reasonable manner. We respond to all complaints within five (5) business days and provide clear guidelines to prevent issues from recurring, and we escalate all complaints involving nonconsensual intimate visual depictions for resolution within forty-eight (48) hours. In all instances, we may temporarily suspend the reported user\u2019s access to some or all features of Fansly while we investigate your complaint. By submitting a complaint, you agree that we may contact you by email if more information is needed from you, and we may, but are not required to, notify you of the outcome of our investigation by email. '
